			<Property name="Id" value="UI_PORTAL_CORE_7" />
			<Property name="English" value="I met a number of intelligent lifeforms in the Space Station. All reacted strangely to the broadcast from the Base Computer, but one responded in a particularly unsettling manner. They spoke in words that were not their own, and when I blinked, I saw that same red light that stared into me at my ship's distress beacon...&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;&lt;IMG&gt;SLASH&lt;&gt; We &lt;&gt;&lt;FUEL&gt;are&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt; watching &lt;&gt;&lt;FUEL&gt;you&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;, Traveller-friend. &lt;IMG&gt;SLASH&lt;&gt; &lt;&gt;&lt;FUEL&gt;Find&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt; what &lt;&gt;&lt;FUEL&gt;we&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt; have &lt;&gt;&lt;FUEL&gt;left&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt; you &lt;IMG&gt;SLASH&lt;&gt;&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;A string of code was echoed back to me through the red glare, logged directly to my Exosuit. Perhaps my &lt;TECHNOLOGY&gt;Base Computer&lt;&gt; would be able to make something of it?" />
