			<Property name="Id" value="UI_PORTAL_CORE_13" />
			<Property name="English" value="I reached a strange space station emitting an anomalous signal, as if it were speaking directly and exclusively to me. A number of other so-called &quot;Travellers&quot; dwelled on board, but it was an unusual Korvax who greeted me.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ I am Priest Entity Nada, divergent Korvax. Welcome to our Anomaly.&#xA;&#xA;Our home here is pleasant, yes? Polo's own design. A perfect bubble, beyond the Sentinels, beyond vengeful Korvax. Nada watches time come and go. }}-&lt;&gt;" />
