		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="UI_PORTAL_CORE_31">
			<Property name="Id" value="UI_PORTAL_CORE_31" />
			<Property name="English" value="Unable to reach Apollo, I encountered another Traveller, named -null-. They seemed unusually aware of my journey.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;I know you, Traveller. I know where you've been. I know where you're going.&#xA;&#xA;What if I told you that Artemis could be saved? What if I told you that Artemis could live once more, after a fashion? What would you do then, I wonder?&#xA;&#xA;The blood of Artemis is data, the heart its glitch. I can help you retrieve them both.&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;They claimed it was possible to restore Artemis' mind and store it in a device they called a 'Mind Ark'." />
