			<Property name="Id" value="UI_PORTAL_CORE_34" />
			<Property name="English" value="It was a relief to hear Apollo again. It felt like we had not spoken in a long time. I told them of the things the Atlas said, how it spoke of 'Travellers' and 'Sentinels' as if we were protocols, not living things. I told them what had happened to Artemis. They sympathised with all I had been through. And then they suggested that we meet.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;I have to go through the portal and join you, that much is clear.&lt;&gt;" />
