			<Property name="English" value="As I looked at Apollo's projection, I thought of all that I saw within the portal, of what happened to Artemis when they walked that same path. I thought of the face of the Atlas, of the way Nada warned me not to return to those tunnels.&#xA;&#xA;I did not know if the portals were safe." />
