			<Property name="Id" value="UI_PORTAL_CORE_42" />
			<Property name="English" value="The &lt;TRANS_WAR&gt;Vy'keen&lt;&gt; told me of the crimes of the Gek, and of their long crusade against the Sentinels. They did not worship the Atlas as the other races did, distrustful of anything with such power, and suggested that if the Atlas is a God, then it is insane." />
