			<Property name="Id" value="UI_PORTAL_CORE_43" />
			<Property name="English" value="The &lt;TRANS_EXP&gt;Korvax&lt;&gt; told me of their past as slaves to the Gek, of the violence that drove them to the Atlas. Even in the depths of their subjugation, there was hope. A bargain, a prayer to a greater being. The Korvax viewed the Atlas as what they might become in time: an intelligence beyond comprehension, beyond judgement.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ Existence is beautiful, if you let it be. Life is not a question. There does not need to be an answer... }}-&lt;&gt;" />
