			<Property name="English" value="The Atlas wanted me to reset it, to plunge myself through its interface at the centre of the galaxy. It had happened before, and it seemed to stop nothing. It still only had 16 minutes left.&#xA;&#xA;I refused. I could not do this... I could not wreak such destruction.&#xA;&#xA;This galaxy is enough for me. I am content to explore, to let fate work its course without me. &#xA;&#xA;The Atlas waits for me, should I change my mind." />
