			<Property name="English" value="The &lt;SPECIAL&gt;Void Egg&lt;&gt; quivered as the lilting music of the alien ship filled my cockpit once again. It was a motion of recognition...&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ The metal masters bind us no more. We are free. We may swim, fly, live... die... }}-&lt;&gt;" />
