			<Property name="Id" value="UI_PORTAL_PIRATES_3" />
			<Property name="English" value="A navigation beacon from the wreck led to a rendezvous point in deep space. I was first confronted by hostile ships - then contacted over my starship communicator.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ You wish to - &lt;&gt;&lt;STELLAR&gt;kzkt&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt; - follow us, to seize your freedom, to reject the grand lies of the - &lt;&gt;&lt;STELLAR&gt;kzktktkt&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt; - Atlas?&#xA;We shall see if you are worthy of - &lt;&gt;&lt;STELLAR&gt;kzzzzkt&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt; - the Voice of Freedom! }}-&lt;&gt;" />
