			<Property name="Id" value="UI_PORTAL_OVERSEER_7" />
			<Property name="English" value="&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ Things are aligning. We are ready now for a Gek farmer to join us. Indeed, I have already prepared their contract. All you need to do is gather the solanium required to finalise their workstation. }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;The Overseer grew in confidence, and sought again to expand my home. I found it hard to disagree with them, for a farmer would open up a world of possibilities." />
