			<Property name="English" value="The Monolith stood forlorn and seemingly forgotten. If I strained, I could see faint marks in the ground where ancient tribes had once come to worship and commune with the edifice. A gust of alien breeze carried a faint whisper of a voice. I struggled to hear it.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;&quot;%ALIEN_TEXT%&quot;&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;Again, the voice echoed around me. Stronger this time. I tried to make out the words desperately crying out for my attention, and did what I could to appease them." />
