			<Property name="English" value="I was suddenly underwater. I was drowning. Water clogged my lungs. My chest was on fire. I gasped for air where there was none, and felt only tepid liquids filling me inside and out. My vision was clouding. I knew this was my time. This was it. This was what it felt like.&#xA;&#xA;Suddenly, a green hand thrust itself through the surface of the water. The light was fading...&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;&quot;%ALIEN_TEXT%&quot;&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;Reality reverted. Perhaps this was how I would face death when it finally, truly, came for me." />
