		<Property name="Table" value="TkLocalisationEntry" _id="UI_PORTAL_SENT_MISS_15_NX_WATER">
			<Property name="Id" value="UI_PORTAL_SENT_MISS_15_NX_WATER" />
			<Property name="English" value="Warnings and alerts rippled through my Exosuit as I approached the abandoned terminal. I reached towards the interface with difficulty, my hand repelled by some unseen force, as though the suit itself was fighting my actions.&#xA;&#xA;Quite suddenly, a device shot out from the terminal, clamping itself to my arm, shackling me in place. I felt something slip beneath my suit, beneath my skin, sharp and probing.&#xA;&#xA;My face grew dry and taut; I was choked with thirst. My suit nutrient system screamed of catastrophic failure. A crimson light grew behind my eyes with my every blink.&#xA;&#xA;Something flashed across the terminal display.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;-{{ Tel – &lt;&gt;&lt;STELLAR&gt;kzkzzt&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt; – power drain complete. Host systems &lt;&gt;&lt;FUEL&gt;desiccated&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;&lt;&gt;. Dispense &lt;&gt;&lt;SPECIAL&gt;water&lt;&gt;&lt;STORY_HIGH&gt;? }}-&lt;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;I placed my hand upon the interface. A thick, freezing liquid immediately rushed into my suit, into my arm. I felt it creep through my veins.&#xA;&#xA;The relief was intense, though an inexplicable sense of dread lingered in the pit of my stomach.&#xA;&#xA;The terminal transferred a set of &lt;SPECIAL&gt;Sentinel Hardframe&lt;&gt; schematics to my Exosuit. I was not sure I understood what just happened, but I was eager to leave that place as soon as possible." />
