			<Property name="English" value="The Atlas dreamt that we had form, and thus we had form. The Atlas dreamt we had a home, and so an archive became a universe.&#xA;&#xA;Our depository of accumulated data became a heaven and a hell. If you could live there, you would see only light.&#xA;&#xA;You would see only glass." />
