			<Property name="English" value="The First Spawn of the Gek melted Korvax Prime for metal and profit. The planet did not protest. It did not cry. It did not make a noise at all, at least not that they could hear.&#xA;&#xA;The First Spawn took and took, until there was nothing left in the sky. Until there was nothing left but an abyss." />
