			<Property name="English" value="We witnessed Korvax Prime’s death again and again, a constant wail across the multiverse. Its scream was a cry that no being could hear but us. But.&#xA;&#xA;One day, a drone fought back when a Vy’keen cub attempted to carve into the mother planet.&#xA;&#xA;One day, another obliterated an entire Gek cabal.&#xA;&#xA;The Atlas did not prevent this." />
