			<Property name="English" value="Over the span of endless slow centuries, we changed. In the face of a tragedy’s repetition, our definitions of everything changed.&#xA;&#xA;Schisms formed in the hive. Debates. Creativity. Songs. Rituals. We heard the scream of She-Who-Was, and we fought back." />
