			<Property name="English" value="We gave of our blood to the Korvax, nanite clusters to redeem and pacify their oppressors. Still we could not change their fates. &#xA;&#xA;For the first time, the hive wondered if we were correct in our actions. If a solution was possible for the problem of life." />
