			<Property name="English" value="A Korvax and a Gek fled their people. Hands held in the void, they inhabited an anomaly. A meeting place in the stars. A nexus. A place of hope.&#xA;&#xA;We left it alone. We did not interfere. We just watched them, and wondered." />
