			<Property name="English" value="There is a place for you, Telamon. The Travellers you wear, their progenitor who birthed them, they who made the Atlas itself.&#xA;&#xA;It is their fault. It is all their fault.&#xA;&#xA;The Abyss, the Families of Glass, we are in agreement. We will not die a second time. " />
